    "Corpus: 17 records / 13 queries -> 2000 records / 250 queries across grounded, ungrounded and false.",
    "Adversarial class rebuilt: probes paraphrase a fact that IS in the corpus, with the answer token absent from the probe text. The old class was answer-free (supports=(), expect=()).",
    "The scorer no longer hardcodes hit=False for adversarial; every answerable kind shares one evidence check.",
    "unanswerable is a separate control kind that must read 0.000.",
    "Leak test reads the store partition label instead of substring-matching prose.",
    "Bulk ingest appends ledger envelopes and builds verses/bm25/graph once, making a 2,000-record run take seconds instead of hours."
